# copyrighted source text, page images and rendered crops never enter git
sources/
**/images/
**/pages/
**/crops/
**/evidence*/
*.pdf
# ...but the skill repo's own packages are CODE, not workspace data: the patterns
# above are written for a WORKSPACE directory, and `sources/` would otherwise hide
# scripts/sources/ (the Stage 1 package) from git entirely. This negation and the
# `sources/` line above must always move together -- see references/traps.md.
!scripts/sources/

# run state and caches
runs/*/tend-root/
detect/*/deps.json
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
